Whenever new data arises (e.g., from Biofeedback, laboratory exams or other sources) the update of the strategy documents must be performed with full respect to the existing structure and formatting (sections, headers, tables, bullet points). The output of the updated text must be ready for copy-pasting, integrating improvements or additions organically into the existing format, ensuring the continuity of the Medicine 3.0 strategy.

